hey [~accountid:5e592fc129e6d00c9707e3b5] 



This instruction is not correct. 

{panel:bgColor=#fffae6}
We can only ask the driver to *name this location* so that we can *find the ride* and *provide the location that matches*, however, {color:#bf2600}*we should NOT ask for any proof or reject the request if this is not provided.*{color}
{panel}

{panel:bgColor=#e3fcef}
*Correct to do:*

* Ask to specify whether the pickup/drop-off is necessary for defending a fine
* Kindly asking to share the location of the pick-up or drop-off to find a respective ride
* If this is not shared, *we cannot reject the request*
{panel}

{panel:bgColor=#ffebe6}
*Not correct to do:*

* Request an official document confirming the fine and location
* Reject the request if this is not provided
{panel}



